
Type {c}three digits{w} to open a page.
{c}100{w} is the index.
{c}Left{w}/{c}Right{w}: previous, next page.
{c}Up{w}/{c}Down{w}: subpages. Several subpages
turn by themselves; {c}H{w} holds.

{c}R{w} reveals hidden answers. Try {c}550{w}.
{c}T{w} shows the page as plain text.
{c}I{w} returns to the index.
{c}Z X C V{w} follow the red, green,
yellow and blue links on the bottom row.

On a phone: number pad under the screen.
No JavaScript needed: there is a form
and links. In a terminal:
{c}curl <this site>/100

{y}Every page is 40 columns by 24 rows.
If it does not fit, it does not ship.
